  "title": "Player Guarantee",
  "kind": "definition",
  "status": "staged",
  "href": "zerosum/zerosum_player_guarantee.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Player Guarantee</h1>\n<p>In a zero-sum game $(I,J,g)$, player 1 guarantees $w$ if there exists\n$i \\in I$ such that $g(i,j) \\ge w$ for every $j \\in J$.  Player 2 guarantees\n$w$ if there exists $j \\in J$ such that $g(i,j) \\le w$ for every $i \\in I$.</p>",
